OL,3,GNEWSAMan and two children taken to
OL,4,Ahospital after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo children and a man have been taken
OL,7,Fto hospital after a collision involving
OL,8,Fa car and three pedestrians in an East
OL,9,FSussex village.
OL,11,FPolice said the man and the two
OL,12,Fchildren, who were all pedestrians,
OL,13,Fwere taken to hospital with injuries
OL,14,Fafter the crash at about 08:30 GMT on
OL,15,Fthe B2240 at The Stream, Catsfield.
OL,17,FA 72-year-old man was arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of causing serious injury by
OL,19,Fdangerous driving and remained in
OL,20,Fcustody. He was also arrested on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of driving while unfit
OL,22,Fthrough drink or drugs, police said.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
